    "description": "Comment SUMMER for more fun activity ideas to try this summer + a list of great animal figurine sets! ☀️🦒\n\nIf you need an easy outdoor setup for a sunny day, shadow tracing is the move. It’s such a fun way to get them outside and working on those fine motor skills while you grab a coffee (or join in!).\n\nAll you need is a roll of paper, some sunshine, and their favorite plastic figurines. It’s amazing to see how the “art” changes as the sun moves! 🖍️✨\n\nSave this for the next sunny day and follow @7daysofplay for more easy play ideas and mom hacks!\n\n[ summer activities for kids, shadow tracing, toddler art projects, preschool science, outdoor play ideas, fine motor skills, boredome busters, 7 Days of Play ]",
